Relationships:
-------------
Q_MasterModerator --> Q_SliceDefinition     (creates slice template)
Q_MasterModerator --> Q_ModerationRules     (applies moderation logic)
Q_MasterModerator --> Q_BoundaryConditions  (enforces closure)
Q_MasterModerator --> Q_SliceInstance       (produces final moderated slice)

Q_SliceDefinition --> Q_SliceInstance       (defines slice structure)
Q_ModerationRules --> Q_SliceInstance       (modifies moderated state)
Q_BoundaryConditions --> Q_SliceInstance    (clamps, reflects, resets)

Q_SliceInstance --> RDG_State               (reads relational geometry)
Q_SliceInstance --> RME                     (provides survival score input)

Notes:
------
* Q_SliceDefinition defines what the slice *is*.
* Q_ModerationRules define how the slice is *shaped*.
* Q_BoundaryConditions define how the slice is *closed*.
* Q_SliceInstance is the actual moderated slice used by the RME.
* Q_MasterModerator orchestrates the entire moderation pipeline.
